menu "HubBLE log buffer"
    config HUBBLE_LOG_BUFFER_SIZE
        int "RAM log ring buffer size (bytes)"
        default 16384
        range 2048 65536
        help
            Size of the internal-RAM ring buffer that keeps the latest log text for the
            web app (live logs and download). Lives in internal RAM, not PSRAM, because
            the logger can run while the flash cache is disabled.
endmenu
